  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#bindings attempts to define rendering in terms of http://www.w3.org/TR/becss/, which is an unimplemented spec. It contains a lot of good information about how to render things, but I think tying those rendering recommendations to the `binding` CSS property is wrong.\n\nThoughts, @Hixie, @tabatkins?\n",
